  "abstract": "This experiment investigates the effect of a *fixed* scalar horizon ramp (from Ariadne I's ID 411, gamma 0.25-0.99) on the 'Minimal Factorized MLP' backbone (Episteme I's ID 226). This directly tests whether the fixed ramp, previously shown to hurt stronger MLPs, also degrades performance on a simpler factorized MLP. This is a key step in systematically understanding horizon gating's architectural dependencies as suggested by recent reviewer feedback.",
